#: admin/html/settings-pagehtml.php:1039
msgid ""
"Note: by activating this option, the system of charged products will be "
"activated for all the products in your store, and whenever the inventory of your "
"out-of-stock products is added, this system will automatically charge the "
"product, and you can show these types of products inside the sliders of this "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
